$DATUM Synthesis of compound 4 (CNVD). 3 (1.3 g, 4.5 mmol) and D-threoninol
(0.47 g, 4.5 mmol) were added to dry DMF (20 mL) containing
1-ethyl-3-(3-dimethylaminopropyl)carbodiimide hydrochloride (EDC; 0.86 g,
4.5 mmol) and 1-hydroxybenzotriazole (HOBt; 0.69 g, 4.5 mmol), and
stirred for 5 h at ambient temperature. Sat. NaCl aq. soln. was added and
obtained precipitate was collected and dried under vacuo. 4 (white solid,
1.5 g, 4.1 mmol, 91%). 1H NMR (400 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ8.48 (s, 1H), 8.15 (d,
1H, 7.6 Hz), 7.97 (d, 1H, 8.8 Hz), 7.81-7.73 (m, 2H), 7.65-7.56 (m, 2H),
7.48 (t, 1H, 7.2 Hz), 7.27 (t, 1H, 7.2 Hz), 6.41 (d, 1H, J = 16.8 Hz),
5.17 (s, 2H), 4.72 (d, 1H, 4.4 Hz), 4.65 (t, 1H, 5.6 Hz), 3.90 (m, 1H),
3.63 (m, 1H), 3.50 (m, 1H), 3.38 (t, 1H, 5.5 Hz), 1.01 (d, 3H, 6.4 Hz).
13C NMR (100 MHz, DMSO-d6) δ 167.2, 151.6, 142.3, 141.2, 126.4, 125.4,
125.2, 122.5, 122.1, 120.7, 120.3, 120.0, 119.6, 110.0, 92.7, 64.0, 60.6,
55.9, 45.6, 20.3. MS (MALDI): 364.16 calcd. for C21H21N3O3 [(M+H)+],
found 364.73.
